  // domain. Falls back to `name` if null.
  wordmark          String?
  logoUrl           String?
  primaryColor      String   @default("#2f5832")
  // When true (default), Spectre platform branding is hidden on this
  // club's domains. Set false to advertise that the club runs on Spectre
  // (rare — usually only for case-study clubs).
  whitelabelEnabled Boolean  @default(true)
  // Sprint 3 · Checkpoint 16F (2026-08-04) — demo/regression tenant
  // marker retained as an environment safeguard. NOT the primary
  // discriminator for fixture writes — see `stagingDataMode` below.
  isDemoTenant      Boolean  @default(false)
  // Sprint 3 · Checkpoint 16F revised (2026-08-04) — data-mode
  // discriminator for fixture / regression / synthetic-demo writes.
  // Coulee Ridge (staging demo AND founder-review tenant) is
  // "FOUNDER_REVIEW": synthetic Members / Vendors / AR balances /
  // Work Intake cards forbidden; only genuine operational work.
  // "REGRESSION": regression documents may be stored + evaluated
  // by the benchmark runner, but no operational wrappers created.
  // "SYNTHETIC_DEMO": synthetic fixtures allowed (dev / disposable
  // test DB only).
  stagingDataMode   String   @default("FOUNDER_REVIEW")
  // Sprint 3 · Checkpoint 16G Stage A (2026-08-04) — IANA timezone
  // identifier for local-calendar arithmetic. Every "today", "since
  // midnight", "overnight" calculation in Mission Control resolves
  // against this. Nullable so onboarding forces an explicit choice —
  // never defaulted to a global timezone. Coulee Ridge = America/Edmonton.
  timezone          String?
