// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 14C. Import templates (saved Jonas / generic column mappings).
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------
// scope:    GLOBAL | CLUB
// status:   DRAFT | PUBLISHED | ARCHIVED
// source:   JONAS | GENERIC_CSV | GENERIC_XLSX | CUSTOM
